| `poly->insertTerm(6.0, 2);` |  |
| `poly->insertTerm(4.0, 5);` |  |
| `poly->insertTerm(4.0, 3);` |  |
| `poly->insertTerm(6.0, 5);` |  |
| `poly->insertTerm(-1.0, 0);` |  |
| `poly->insertTerm(-6.0, 6);` |  |
| `poly->insertTerm(6.0, 6);` |  |
| `poly->print();` |  |

Complete the following functions:

```cpp
